    {
      "id": "bjlvsga",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "12.2 Media in Arunachal Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "id": "38npx4n",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Arunachal Pradesh has the lowest newspaper readership per capita in India.",
        "Doordarshan Kendra Itanagar broadcasts regional programming.",
        "All India Radio (AIR) Itanagar covers state news.",
        "Major newspapers include Arunachal Times, Arunachal Front, and The Arunachal Sun.",
        "Internet penetration is low but improving with BharatNet and 4G expansion."
      ]
    },
